<%# A host's own layout, which every generated Rails app has and this one therefore
    has too. Nothing the gem serves renders inside it: `RecoursesController` implies
    `layouts/recourses`, which it finds in the gem before Rails ever falls through to
    here. Every assertion in the suite about the navbar, the sidebar or the primary
    color is an assertion that this file lost. -%>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <title>The dummy app's own layout</title>
    <%= csrf_meta_tags %>
  </head>

  <body>
    <%= yield %>
  </body>
</html>
